{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20279","headline":"关山月 · 张籍","name":"关山月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋月朗朗关山上，山中行人马蹄响。\n关山秋来雨雪多，行人见月唱边歌。\n海边茫茫天气白，胡儿夜度黄龙碛。\n军中探骑暮出城，伏兵暗处低旌戟。\n溪水连天霜草平，野驼寻水碛中鸣。\n陇头风急雁不下，沙场苦战多流星。\n可怜万国关山道，年年战骨多秋草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}